<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the week August 4-10 and the total for 1997/98.</p>
<p>		 Aug 4-10    Aug 5-11	  TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1997/98     1996/97	1997/98	1996/97</p>
<p> Stocks/open   300,769.6   259,742.1</p>
<p> Production     48,415.3    36,478.1   320,755.6    216,756.5</p>
<p> Shipment	 15,697.8    18,911.9   109,692.9    108,019.6</p>
<p> Home Market	 348.4	 205.3     1,836.1	1,573.9</p>
<p> Stocks/close  333,138.7   277,103.6</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
